<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Fletcher Challenge upped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Fletcher Challenge upped.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said analyst Andrew McGann in Melbourne, Australia upgraded Fletcher Challenge Energy to near-term neutral from reduce, and kept the long-term neutral rating.</p>
<p>-- analyst not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- ADRs closed Friday up 3/4 to 29-1/2.</p>
</text>
